invariant: INV-14
file: handshake_post.h
catches: unit
reason: hspost_present_ticket takes a kept ticket whose PSK length is no
  hash length this build holds, and a raw or ca build checks a PSK's
  length only for a 0. The key schedule then reads psk_len bytes from a
  ch_ticket.psk of HKDF_HASH_MAX bytes, past its end when the length is
  larger. The unit test's 31-byte PSK row requires CH_EINVAL.

--- old
    if ((psk_len != SHA256_LEN && psk_len != HKDF_HASH_MAX) || saved->ticket.lifetime_s == 0) {
--- new
    if (saved->ticket.lifetime_s == 0) {
